NOTE TITLE: [[Expand rectangles horizontally keep text centered]]

METADATA:{"created":"2025/12/17 12:03:45","modified":"2025/12/17 12:03:45","chunkId":"Excalidraw/Scripts/Downloaded/Expand rectangles horizontally keep text centered.md#0","heading":""}

